# Play words (Idle Party)

Confirmed by the owner **2026-10-10**. "Natt" is confusing. Do not use it
for a sitting, the reason to come back tomorrow, or one climb of a hunt.

Use the industry words. The first time in a chat, add the Swedish meaning.

| Word | Means | Say once |
|---|---|---|
| session | one sitting | ett sittande |
| daily | the one job that brings them back tomorrow | dagens jobb |
| run | one climb of a hunt | ett varv |

In-game text stays English: KEY, Gauntlet, Ranked GR, Farm Rift, Ashen Crown.

KEY is the daily. A Gauntlet stretch is a run. Ranked GR and Farm Rift are
different runs. A batch the player can sit down for is a session.
